# Base origin for the v2 tier data files (archive/recent/forecast .csv.gz).
# The frontend fetches these DIRECTLY from R2's public URL — reads never hit the
# Worker. See ARCHITECTURE.md ("Reads go direct to R2 / CDN, never through a
# Worker") and frontend/src/services/tieredData.ts (DATA_BASE).
#
# Public r2.dev URL for the weather-baseline bucket. Not a secret (read-only
# public endpoint). Swap to a custom domain later with no code change.
#
# In local dev, leave this UNSET (use .env.local to override to '') to fall back
# to the Vite proxy → Node backend's /data route instead of hitting R2.
VITE_DATA_BASE=https://pub-403d94ceb15c48af9cb6005b1d541e82.r2.dev
